<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <body style="font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 24px; color: #1a1a1a;">
    {{#if self_harm}}
    <p style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #b42318; margin: 0 0 16px;">This is a self-harm or suicide report. Review it first.</p>
    {{/if}}
    <h1 style="font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 16px;">{{kind_label}}</h1>
    <p>A member filed a report. The app tells members that reports are reviewed within 24 hours.</p>
    <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 16px 0; font-size: 15px;">
      <tr><td style="padding: 6px 0;">Report id</td><td style="padding: 6px 0; text-align: right;">{{report_id}}</td></tr>
      <tr><td style="padding: 6px 0;">Kind</td><td style="padding: 6px 0; text-align: right;">{{kind_label}}</td></tr>
      <tr><td style="padding: 6px 0;">Reason</td><td style="padding: 6px 0; text-align: right;">{{reason_label}}</td></tr>
      <tr><td style="padding: 6px 0;">Reported content</td><td style="padding: 6px 0; text-align: right;">{{target_type}} {{target_id}}</td></tr>
      <tr><td style="padding: 6px 0;">Filed</td><td style="padding: 6px 0; text-align: right;">{{time_pt}} ({{time_utc}})</td></tr>
    </table>
    <p>{{review_hint}}</p>
    <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eaeaea; margin: 32px 0;" />
    <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #888;">This email holds ids only. The reported content and the people involved are in the app and the database.</p>
  </body>
</html>
